flowchart TD
    %% Notifications Main Hub
    NOT[🔔 NOTIFICATIONS CENTER<br/>Real-time Command Center<br/>Operational Awareness Hub]
    
    %% Navigation from Dashboard
    DASH[🏥 Dashboard] --> NOT
    
    %% Real-Time Alert Center Section
    NOT --> RTA[🚨 Real-Time Alert Center<br/>Operational Awareness<br/>Critical Notifications]
    RTA --> RTAP[💳 Payment Alert Panel<br/>Failed Payment Tracking]
    RTA --> RTAA[📅 Appointment Alert Panel<br/>New Booking Notifications]
    RTA --> RTAB[💰 Billing Cycle Alert Panel<br/>Service Charge Reminders]
    
    RTAP --> RTAPM[💳 Payment Alert Modal<br/>🚨 FAILED PAYMENT DETAILS<br/>⚠️ High Priority Alert<br/>📋 Transaction Information:<br/>Patient: Sarah Johnson<br/>Amount: KES 2,500<br/>Service: General Consultation<br/>Payment Method: M-Pesa<br/>Failure Reason: Insufficient Funds<br/>Attempt Time: 14:32 Today<br/>Invoice ID: INV-2024-001247<br/>📞 Patient Contact:<br/>Phone: +254-XXX-XXXX<br/>Email: sarah.j@email.com<br/>🔄 Retry Options:<br/>• Different Payment Method<br/>• Reduced Amount<br/>• Payment Plan<br/>📊 Payment History:<br/>Previous Attempts: 2<br/>Last Successful: 15 days ago<br/>Average Payment: KES 1,800<br/>💡 Recommended Actions:<br/>• Contact patient within 2 hours<br/>• Offer payment alternatives<br/>• Schedule follow-up consultation<br/>Action Buttons:<br/>[Contact Patient] [Retry Payment] [Create Payment Plan] [View Full History] [Mark Resolved]]
    
    RTAA --> RTAAM[📅 Appointment Alert Modal<br/>📋 NEW APPOINTMENT REQUEST<br/>🔔 Medium Priority Alert<br/>👤 Patient Information:<br/>Name: Michael Chen<br/>Phone: +254-XXX-XXXX<br/>Type: New Patient<br/>📋 Appointment Details:<br/>Service: General Consultation<br/>Preferred Date: Tomorrow, 10:00 AM<br/>Duration: 30 minutes<br/>Special Notes: Follow-up for blood pressure<br/>👨‍⚕️ Doctor Assignment:<br/>Requested: Dr. Sarah Johnson<br/>Alternative: Dr. Michael Wilson<br/>Availability Status: ✅ Available<br/>📊 Booking Context:<br/>Booking Method: Patient Portal<br/>Time Requested: 30 minutes ago<br/>Previous Visits: 0 (New Patient)<br/>💡 Auto-Suggestions:<br/>• Confirm with Dr. Sarah<br/>• Send confirmation SMS<br/>• Prepare new patient forms<br/>Action Buttons:<br/>[Confirm Appointment] [Assign Different Doctor] [Reschedule] [Request More Info] [Auto-Confirm]]
    
    RTAB --> RTABM[💰 Billing Cycle Alert Modal<br/>💳 UPCOMING SERVICE CHARGE DEDUCTION<br/>🔔 Low Priority Reminder<br/>📊 Billing Period Information:<br/>Current Cycle: Weekly (Monday-Sunday)<br/>Cycle End: In 2 days (Sunday)<br/>Next Deduction: Monday, 9:00 AM<br/>💰 Financial Overview:<br/>Total Revenue This Week: KES 45,600<br/>Curis Service Fee (20%): KES 9,120<br/>Net Clinic Income: KES 36,480<br/>📈 Comparison:<br/>Last Week: KES 42,300 (+7.8%)<br/>Monthly Average: KES 41,200<br/>💳 Payment Method:<br/>Auto-Deduction: M-Pesa (***-XXX-789)<br/>Backup Method: Bank Transfer<br/>Account Status: ✅ Active<br/>📋 Transaction Details:<br/>Reference: AUTO-WK-2024-47<br/>Processing Time: 5-10 minutes<br/>Receipt: Auto-generated<br/>⚙️ Settings Options:<br/>• Change payment frequency<br/>• Update payment method<br/>• View payment history<br/>Action Buttons:<br/>[View Details] [Change Settings] [Download Receipt] [Contact Support] [Acknowledge]]
    
    %% Internal Clinic Notifications Section
    NOT --> ICN[📢 Internal Notifications<br/>Staff Communication<br/>Clinic Announcements]
    ICN --> ICNS[📣 Staff Announcements<br/>Policy/Schedule Updates]
    ICN --> ICNA[📅 Appointment Reminders<br/>Staff Schedule Notifications]
    ICN --> ICNSH[⏰ Shift Notifications<br/>Schedule Change Alerts]
    
    ICNS --> ICNSM[📣 Staff Announcements Modal<br/>📢 CREATE CLINIC ANNOUNCEMENT<br/>🎯 Announcement Details:<br/>Title: [Enter announcement title]<br/>Message: [Rich text editor area]<br/>Priority Level:<br/>○ High (Urgent - Red badge)<br/>○ Medium (Important - Yellow badge)<br/>○ Low (Informational - Blue badge)<br/>📤 Recipient Selection:<br/>☑️ All Staff Members<br/>☐ Doctors Only<br/>☐ Receptionists Only<br/>☐ Custom Selection:<br/>  ☐ Dr. Sarah Johnson<br/>  ☐ Dr. Michael Wilson<br/>  ☐ Receptionist Mary<br/>  ☐ Receptionist John<br/>📅 Scheduling Options:<br/>○ Send Immediately<br/>○ Schedule for Later:<br/>  Date: [Date picker]<br/>  Time: [Time picker]<br/>🔔 Delivery Preferences:<br/>☑️ In-App Notification<br/>☑️ Email Notification<br/>☐ SMS Notification<br/>📋 Additional Options:<br/>☑️ Require Read Receipt<br/>☐ Allow Staff Replies<br/>☐ Pin to Top<br/>☐ Auto-Delete After: [Days]<br/>📊 Preview Section:<br/>[Live preview of announcement]<br/>Action Buttons:<br/>[Send Now] [Schedule] [Save Draft] [Preview] [Cancel]]
    
    ICNA --> ICNAM[📅 Appointment Reminders Modal<br/>⏰ STAFF APPOINTMENT REMINDERS<br/>📋 Today's Schedule Reminders:<br/>👨‍⚕️ Dr. Sarah Johnson:<br/>• 09:00 AM - Michael Chen (General Consultation)<br/>• 10:30 AM - Lisa Wong (Follow-up)<br/>• 02:00 PM - Peter Kim (Blood Test Review)<br/>• 04:00 PM - Jane Doe (New Patient)<br/>👨‍⚕️ Dr. Michael Wilson:<br/>• 08:30 AM - Robert Smith (Pediatric Checkup)<br/>• 11:00 AM - Alice Brown (Vaccination)<br/>• 03:30 PM - David Lee (Consultation)<br/>👩‍💼 Reception Staff:<br/>• Reminder: 5 new patients need registration forms<br/>• Follow-up: 3 pending payment confirmations<br/>• Task: Update patient contact information<br/>⚙️ Reminder Settings:<br/>Send Reminders:<br/>○ 24 hours before<br/>○ 2 hours before<br/>○ 30 minutes before<br/>Notification Method:<br/>☑️ In-App Alert<br/>☑️ Email<br/>☐ SMS<br/>📊 Staff Response Tracking:<br/>• Dr. Sarah: ✅ Acknowledged (2 min ago)<br/>• Dr. Michael: ⏳ Pending<br/>• Mary (Reception): ✅ Acknowledged (5 min ago)<br/>Action Buttons:<br/>[Send Reminder Now] [Update Schedule] [Staff Response Log] [Settings] [Close]]
    
    ICNSH --> ICNSHM[⏰ Shift Notifications Modal<br/>📅 SCHEDULE CHANGE MANAGEMENT<br/>🔄 Recent Schedule Changes:<br/>📅 Today's Changes:<br/>• Dr. Sarah Johnson: Extended hours until 7:00 PM<br/>  Reason: Emergency patient<br/>  Status: ✅ Confirmed<br/>• Receptionist John: Started 1 hour early<br/>  Reason: Staff shortage<br/>  Status: ✅ Approved<br/>📅 Upcoming Changes (Next 7 Days):<br/>• Monday: Dr. Michael on leave (morning)<br/>  Replacement: Dr. Sarah (double shift)<br/>  Status: ⏳ Pending confirmation<br/>• Wednesday: New staff orientation<br/>  Time: 2:00 PM - 4:00 PM<br/>  Affected: All reception staff<br/>  Status: 📋 Planned<br/>🔔 Notification Preferences:<br/>Send Alerts For:<br/>☑️ Schedule Extensions<br/>☑️ Emergency Changes<br/>☑️ Staff Replacements<br/>☑️ Leave Approvals<br/>☐ Minor Adjustments<br/>Alert Recipients:<br/>☑️ Affected Staff Only<br/>☐ All Staff<br/>☐ Clinic Owner Only<br/>📊 Impact Analysis:<br/>• Patient Appointments Affected: 12<br/>• Revenue Impact: KES 18,500<br/>• Staff Overtime Hours: 4.5<br/>Action Buttons:<br/>[Approve Changes] [Request Modification] [Send Notifications] [View Calendar] [Cancel Changes]]
    
    %% Notification Settings Section
    NOT --> NS[⚙️ Notification Settings<br/>Alert Configuration<br/>Preference Management]
    NS --> NSP[🎛️ Preference Panel<br/>Alert Type Toggles]
    NS --> NSC[📱 Channel Selection<br/>App/Email/SMS Options]
    NS --> NSF[🏷️ Priority Filters<br/>High/Medium/Low Sorting]
    
    NSP --> NSPM[🎛️ Notification Preferences Modal<br/>⚙️ ALERT CONFIGURATION PANEL<br/>💳 Payment & Financial Alerts:<br/>☑️ Failed Payment Attempts<br/>☑️ Successful Payments<br/>☑️ Overdue Invoices<br/>☑️ Service Charge Deductions<br/>☐ Daily Revenue Summary<br/>☐ Weekly Financial Reports<br/>📅 Appointment Alerts:<br/>☑️ New Appointment Requests<br/>☑️ Appointment Cancellations<br/>☑️ No-show Notifications<br/>☐ Appointment Confirmations<br/>☐ Reschedule Requests<br/>👥 Staff Alerts:<br/>☑️ Staff Inactivity (>3 days)<br/>☑️ Performance Issues<br/>☑️ Leave Requests<br/>☐ Daily Activity Summary<br/>☐ Staff Login/Logout<br/>🏥 System Alerts:<br/>☑️ System Maintenance<br/>☑️ Security Issues<br/>☑️ Data Backup Status<br/>☐ Software Updates<br/>☐ Integration Errors<br/>📊 Alert Frequency:<br/>○ Real-time (Immediate)<br/>○ Batched (Every 30 minutes)<br/>○ Daily Summary (End of day)<br/>○ Custom Frequency<br/>🔇 Do Not Disturb:<br/>Start Time: [Time picker]<br/>End Time: [Time picker]<br/>Days: [Weekday selector]<br/>Action Buttons:<br/>[Save Preferences] [Reset to Default] [Test Notifications] [Export Settings] [Cancel]]
    
    NSC --> NSCM[📱 Channel Selection Modal<br/>📡 NOTIFICATION DELIVERY CHANNELS<br/>📱 In-App Notifications:<br/>☑️ Enabled<br/>Display Duration: [5] seconds<br/>Sound Alert: ☑️ Enabled<br/>Badge Counter: ☑️ Show on icon<br/>Position: Top-right corner<br/>📧 Email Notifications:<br/>☑️ Enabled<br/>Primary Email: owner@clinic.com<br/>Backup Email: [Optional email]<br/>Email Format:<br/>○ HTML (Rich formatting)<br/>○ Plain Text<br/>Frequency: ○ Immediate ○ Daily Digest<br/>📱 SMS Notifications:<br/>☑️ Enabled<br/>Primary Phone: +254-XXX-XXXX<br/>Backup Phone: [Optional phone]<br/>SMS Provider: Safaricom<br/>International: ☐ Enabled<br/>🔔 Push Notifications (Mobile App):<br/>☑️ Enabled<br/>Device Registration: ✅ Active<br/>Sound: Default clinic tone<br/>Vibration: ☑️ Enabled<br/>📊 Delivery Preferences:<br/>High Priority: All channels<br/>Medium Priority: In-app + Email<br/>Low Priority: In-app only<br/>📈 Channel Performance:<br/>Email Delivery Rate: 98.5%<br/>SMS Delivery Rate: 99.2%<br/>In-app View Rate: 87.3%<br/>Action Buttons:<br/>[Save Channels] [Test All Channels] [View Delivery Stats] [Reset] [Cancel]]
    
    NSF --> NSFM[🏷️ Priority Filter Modal<br/>🎯 NOTIFICATION PRIORITY SYSTEM<br/>🔴 HIGH PRIORITY (Critical):<br/>Triggers:<br/>☑️ Payment Failures (>KES 5,000)<br/>☑️ System Security Alerts<br/>☑️ Staff Emergency Situations<br/>☑️ Patient Safety Alerts<br/>Display: Red badge, sound alert<br/>Response Time: Immediate action required<br/>Auto-Escalation: After 15 minutes<br/>🟡 MEDIUM PRIORITY (Important):<br/>Triggers:<br/>☑️ New Appointment Requests<br/>☑️ Schedule Changes<br/>☑️ Service Charge Reminders<br/>☑️ Staff Performance Alerts<br/>Display: Yellow badge, soft notification<br/>Response Time: Within 2 hours<br/>Auto-Escalation: After 4 hours<br/>🔵 LOW PRIORITY (Informational):<br/>Triggers:<br/>☑️ Daily Activity Summary<br/>☑️ System Updates<br/>☑️ General Announcements<br/>☑️ Marketing Messages<br/>Display: Blue badge, no sound<br/>Response Time: When convenient<br/>Auto-Escalation: None<br/>⚙️ Filter Settings:<br/>Show Only:<br/>○ All Priorities<br/>○ High + Medium<br/>○ High Only<br/>○ Custom Selection<br/>📊 Priority Statistics:<br/>Today: High(3) Medium(8) Low(12)<br/>Week: High(15) Medium(45) Low(87)<br/>🔄 Auto-Classification Rules:<br/>☑️ Enable smart priority detection<br/>☑️ Learn from user actions<br/>☑️ Adjust based on clinic hours<br/>Action Buttons:<br/>[Apply Filters] [Save as Default] [Reset Priorities] [View Statistics] [Cancel]]
    
