    NHS --> NHSM_MODAL[🔍 Notification History Search Modal<br/>📋 COMPREHENSIVE NOTIFICATION LOG<br/>🔍 Search & Filter Options:<br/>Search Query: [Enter keywords...]<br/>📅 Date Range:<br/>From: [Date picker]<br/>To: [Date picker]<br/>Quick Filters:<br/>[Today] [This Week] [This Month] [Last 30 Days]<br/>🏷️ Notification Type:<br/>☐ All Types<br/>☐ Payment Alerts<br/>☐ Appointment Notifications<br/>☐ Staff Messages<br/>☐ System Alerts<br/>☐ Billing Reminders<br/>👤 Source Filter:<br/>☐ All Sources<br/>☐ System Generated<br/>☐ Staff Created<br/>☐ Patient Triggered<br/>☐ External Integration<br/>🎯 Priority Level:<br/>☐ All Priorities<br/>☐ High Priority Only<br/>☐ Medium Priority Only<br/>☐ Low Priority Only<br/>📊 Status Filter:<br/>☐ All Status<br/>☐ Unread<br/>☐ Read<br/>☐ Action Required<br/>☐ Resolved<br/>☐ Archived<br/>📋 Search Results (Last 100 matches):<br/>📅 Today, 15:45 - Payment Alert: Failed payment KES 2,500<br/>  Status: 🔴 Action Required | Priority: High<br/>  [View Details] [Mark Resolved]<br/>📅 Today, 14:30 - New Appointment: Michael Chen booking<br/>  Status: ✅ Resolved | Priority: Medium<br/>  [View Details] [Reopen]<br/>📅 Today, 12:15 - Staff Message: Dr. Sarah schedule change<br/>  Status: 👁️ Read | Priority: Low<br/>  [View Details] [Archive]<br/>📊 Summary Statistics:<br/>Total Notifications: 1,247<br/>Unread: 23 | Action Required: 8<br/>Average Response Time: 2.3 hours<br/>Action Buttons:<br/>[Export Results] [Bulk Actions] [Clear Filters] [Advanced Search] [Close]]
    
    NHSM --> NHSMM[📊 Status Management Modal<br/>🏷️ NOTIFICATION STATUS CONTROL<br/>📋 Status Categories:<br/>🔵 UNREAD (47 notifications)<br/>Recent unread items that need attention<br/>Auto-mark as read: After 24 hours<br/>Highlight: Blue dot indicator<br/>👁️ READ (234 notifications)<br/>Acknowledged notifications<br/>Auto-archive: After 30 days<br/>Display: Normal text<br/>⚠️ ACTION REQUIRED (12 notifications)<br/>Critical items needing response<br/>Escalation: After 4 hours<br/>Highlight: Red badge + sound<br/>✅ RESOLVED (89 notifications)<br/>Completed actions and responses<br/>Auto-archive: After 7 days<br/>Display: Green checkmark<br/>📦 ARCHIVED (865 notifications)<br/>Historical records for reference<br/>Retention: 1 year<br/>Access: Search only<br/>🔄 Bulk Status Operations:<br/>Select Multiple: ☐ Enable bulk selection<br/>Bulk Actions:<br/>• Mark as Read<br/>• Require Action<br/>• Mark as Resolved<br/>• Archive Selected<br/>• Delete Selected<br/>📊 Status Analytics:<br/>Response Rate: 94.2%<br/>Average Resolution Time: 3.1 hours<br/>Overdue Actions: 3 items<br/>⚙️ Auto-Status Rules:<br/>☑️ Auto-mark payment confirmations as resolved<br/>☑️ Auto-archive read items after 30 days<br/>☑️ Flag overdue actions after 6 hours<br/>Action Buttons:<br/>[Apply Changes] [Bulk Process] [Export Status Report] [Reset Rules] [Close]]
    
    NHAT --> NHATM[📋 Action Tracking Modal<br/>📊 NOTIFICATION RESPONSE ANALYTICS<br/>🎯 Action Categories:<br/>💳 Payment Actions:<br/>• Payment Retry Initiated: 15 times<br/>• Patient Contact Made: 23 times<br/>• Payment Plan Created: 8 times<br/>• Invoice Adjustment: 4 times<br/>Average Resolution Time: 2.1 hours<br/>📅 Appointment Actions:<br/>• Appointments Confirmed: 45 times<br/>• Doctor Reassigned: 12 times<br/>• Schedule Modified: 18 times<br/>• Patient Contacted: 31 times<br/>Average Response Time: 45 minutes<br/>👥 Staff Actions:<br/>• Messages Sent: 67 times<br/>• Schedule Changes: 23 times<br/>• Performance Reviews: 5 times<br/>• Training Scheduled: 3 times<br/>Average Follow-up: 1.8 hours<br/>📊 Response Performance:<br/>📈 This Week's Statistics:<br/>Total Actions Taken: 156<br/>Successful Resolutions: 142 (91%)<br/>Pending Actions: 14<br/>Overdue Items: 3<br/>📅 Response Time Trends:<br/>Monday: 1.2 hours avg.<br/>Tuesday: 2.1 hours avg.<br/>Wednesday: 1.8 hours avg.<br/>Thursday: 2.5 hours avg.<br/>Friday: 3.2 hours avg.<br/>🏆 Performance Metrics:<br/>Best Response Day: Monday<br/>Peak Alert Time: 2:00 PM - 4:00 PM<br/>Most Common Action: Patient Contact<br/>Highest Success Rate: Payment Retries (95%)<br/>📋 Action Templates:<br/>• Standard payment follow-up<br/>• Appointment confirmation<br/>• Staff schedule change<br/>• System maintenance notice<br/>Action Buttons:<br/>[Create Action Template] [Export Analytics] [Schedule Report] [Performance Review] [Close]]
    
