    AAS --> AASM[🚨 System Alert Modal<br/>🤖 AUTOMATED SYSTEM ALERTS<br/>⚠️ Active System Warnings:<br/>🔴 CRITICAL ALERTS:<br/>• Server Response Time: 5.2s (Threshold: 3s)<br/>  Impact: Slow patient booking<br/>  Detected: 15 minutes ago<br/>  Auto-Action: IT support contacted<br/>  [View Details] [Escalate]<br/>• Database Connection: 2 failed attempts<br/>  Impact: Appointment sync issues<br/>  Detected: 8 minutes ago<br/>  Auto-Action: Backup system activated<br/>  [View Details] [Manual Sync]<br/>🟡 WARNING ALERTS:<br/>• Storage Space: 87% full (Threshold: 85%)<br/>  Impact: Limited file uploads<br/>  Detected: 2 hours ago<br/>  Auto-Action: Cleanup scheduled<br/>  [View Details] [Free Space Now]<br/>• Failed Login Attempts: 12 in last hour<br/>  Impact: Potential security risk<br/>  Detected: 30 minutes ago<br/>  Auto-Action: IP monitoring enabled<br/>  [View Details] [Block Suspicious IPs]<br/>🔵 INFORMATIONAL ALERTS:<br/>• System Backup: Completed successfully<br/>  Status: All data secured<br/>  Completed: 3:00 AM today<br/>  Next Backup: Tomorrow 3:00 AM<br/>  [View Backup Report]<br/>• Software Update: Available<br/>  Version: 2.4.1 → 2.4.2<br/>  Features: Bug fixes, performance improvements<br/>  Scheduled: This weekend<br/>  [View Release Notes] [Schedule Now]<br/>📊 System Health Dashboard:<br/>Server Uptime: 99.8%<br/>Response Time: 2.1s avg.<br/>Active Users: 23<br/>Data Sync Status: ✅ Normal<br/>Action Buttons:<br/>[Resolve All] [System Status] [Contact IT Support] [Schedule Maintenance] [Close]]
    
    AAT --> AATM[⚙️ Threshold Settings Modal<br/>🎯 ALERT TRIGGER CONFIGURATION<br/>💰 Financial Thresholds:<br/>Failed Payment Alert:<br/>Amount Threshold: KES [5,000] and above<br/>Frequency: After [2] consecutive failures<br/>Auto-Action: ☑️ Contact patient immediately<br/>Daily Revenue Drop:<br/>Percentage: [20]% below average<br/>Comparison Period: Last [30] days<br/>Auto-Action: ☑️ Generate investigation report<br/>Outstanding Balance:<br/>Amount: KES [10,000] per patient<br/>Age: [7] days overdue<br/>Auto-Action: ☑️ Send payment reminder<br/>📅 Appointment Thresholds:<br/>No-show Rate:<br/>Percentage: [15]% of daily appointments<br/>Time Period: [Weekly] average<br/>Auto-Action: ☑️ Review booking policies<br/>Booking Volume Drop:<br/>Percentage: [30]% below normal<br/>Comparison: Same day last [4] weeks<br/>Auto-Action: ☑️ Marketing alert<br/>Cancellation Rate:<br/>Percentage: [25]% of bookings<br/>Time Period: [Daily] tracking<br/>Auto-Action: ☑️ Investigate causes<br/>👥 Staff Performance Thresholds:<br/>Inactivity Alert:<br/>Duration: [3] days without login<br/>Apply to: ☑️ All staff ☐ Specific roles<br/>Auto-Action: ☑️ Send reminder + supervisor alert<br/>Patient Rating Drop:<br/>Rating: Below [4.0] stars<br/>Review Count: Minimum [5] ratings<br/>Auto-Action: ☑️ Schedule performance review<br/>🏥 System Performance Thresholds:<br/>Response Time:<br/>Threshold: [3] seconds<br/>Monitoring: ☑️ Continuous<br/>Auto-Action: ☑️ IT support notification<br/>Storage Space:<br/>Warning Level: [85]%<br/>Critical Level: [95]%<br/>Auto-Action: ☑️ Cleanup old files<br/>Action Buttons:<br/>[Save Thresholds] [Test Alerts] [Reset to Default] [Import Config] [Export Settings]]
    
